<title>UK: GOLF-BRITISH OPEN THIRD ROUND LEADERBOARD.</title>
<headline>GOLF-BRITISH OPEN THIRD ROUND LEADERBOARD.</headline>
<text>
<p>TROON, Scotland - Third round leaderboard at the British</p>
<p>Open (par-71) on Saturday (British unless stated, *denotes</p>
<p>amateur):</p>
<p>10 under - Darren Clarke (after 51 holes)</p>
<p>	    - Jesper Parnevik (Sweden) (52)</p>
<p>7 under  - Fred Couples (U.S.) (52)</p>
<p>5 under  - Justin Leonard (U.S.) (51)</p>
<p>4 under  - Eduardo Romero (Argentina) (54)</p>
<p>		Stephen Ames (Trinidad) (54)</p>
<p>		Jim Furyk (U.S.) (53)</p>
<p>3 under  - Tiger Woods (U.S.) (54)</p>
<p>		Robert Allenby (Australia) (54)</p>
<p>		Lee Westwood (54)</p>
</text>
